      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "District 3, East End, is likely to face the fastest initial spread due to its very high density, limited healthcare access, and close-quarters living situations. District 2, Riverbend, also presents a high risk because of its high density and reliance on public transit, facilitating easy person-to-person transmission. Conversely, Districts 1 and 4 have profiles suggesting lower initial transmission risk due to lower density or high remote-work capabilities.",
